<p>The first version of <b>The Swamp level</b> was added mainly because I wasn´t sure I could make it till the deadline. Version 0.1 has no lights, though it got light probe (makes water look nice&#160;:) ). It has village finished and all plants in level planted.
</p><p><br />
</p>
